    "extraction_notes": [
      "Supplied PDF SHA-256 verified as 7666f9d7519419114313559d962a506b2ad693c23e4d19595f8d7f2928074c68.",
      "Electrical characteristics heading states TJ = 25 degC unless otherwise specified.",
      "The supplied PDF does not state a document revision.",
      "Figure 1 output curves are labelled VGS = 2.5 V, 3 V, 3.5 V, 5 V, 8 V, and 10 V; the figure does not state temperature.",
      "Figure 2 provides separate typical transfer curves at TJ = 25 degC and TJ = 125 degC.",
      "RDS(on) typical rows are 7.6 mOhm maximum-rated at 10 V and 20 A, and 11.5 mOhm maximum-rated at 4.5 V and 10 A. The corresponding datasheet maximum values are 10 mOhm and 17 mOhm, respectively.",
      "Ciss = 1011 pF, Coss = 142 pF, and Crss = 119 pF are typical values at VDS = 15 V, VGS = 0 V, and f = 1.0 MHz; values are converted to farads in specs.",
      "The body-diode table publishes VSD maximum 1.2 V at VGS = 0 V and IS = 30 A. It also publishes trr typical 7 ns at IF = 30 A and di/dt = 100 A/us, and Qrr typical 6.3 nC.",
      "IDSS maximum is 1 uA at VDS = 30 V and VGS = 0 V. IGSS maximum is +/-100 nA at VDS = 0 V and VGS = +/-20 V.",
      "Typical gate-charge table values are Qg = 19 nC, Qgs = 6.3 nC, and Qgd = 4.5 nC at VDS = 15 V, ID = 20 A, and VGS = 10 V. The plotted gate-charge curve is included as an independent typical curve.",
      "Thermal data publishes only RthetaJC maximum 5.26 degC/W; RthetaJA is not published.",
      "Figures 7 and 8 contain normalized temperature curves, while Figures 9 through 11 contain SOA and transient thermal plots. They were not included as direct MOSFET electrical curve families because their normalized or thermal semantics are not represented by the required specs fields."
    ],
